+# The Through-Line
+
+A clear, editorial lesson about career repositioning as revealing—not replacing—the value already present in a career. Three professional stories move across a visual career line, then resolve into a practical four-step path.
+
+## Visual idea
+
+A continuous gold-and-blue line connects evidence from the past to a focused future role. Alex, Jordan, and Priya each receive a distinct evidence card and forward-facing role label. The final section turns their shared pattern into four practical actions.
+
+## Teaching promise
+
+Viewers leave able to clarify a target, curate relevant proof, translate their language, and update the public signals that make the next move legible.
